### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/
### Create author
POST http://localhost:3000/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Chinua Achebe", "country": "Nigeria", "bio": "Nigerian novelist" }
###
@authorId = 6af23693ca9915b64df768f9

### Get all authors
GET http://localhost:3000/authors

### Get one author
GET http://localhost:3000/authors/{{authorId}}

### Update author
PUT http://localhost:3000/authors/{{authorId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bio": "Author of Things Fall Apart" }

### Missing name (should be 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Author not found (should be 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/authors/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

### Invalid id (should be 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/authors/abc
### Create book
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Things Fall Apart", "genre": "Fiction", "price": 15, "publishedYear": 1958, "author": "{{authorId}}" }
###
@bookId = 6af237b4ca9915b64df768fb

### Get all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### Get one book
GET http://localhost:3000/books/{{bookId}}

### Update book
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 19 }

### Book not found (should be 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

### Books by author
GET http://localhost:3000/authors/{{authorId}}/books

### Author not found (should be 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/authors/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011/books
### Rule 1: fake author (should be 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Ghost Book", "genre": "Fiction", "price": 10, "publishedYear": 2000, "author": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011" }
### Rule 2: duplicate title, different case (should be 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "things fall apart", "genre": "Fiction", "price": 12, "publishedYear": 1958, "author": "{{authorId}}" }

### Rule 2: update book with its own title (should be 200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Things Fall Apart" }

### Create second author
POST http://localhost:3000/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ngugi wa Thiong'o", "country": "Kenya" }
###
@authorId2 = 6af23bc33670ebef2b7c2a42

### Rule 2: same title, different author (should be 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Things Fall Apart", "genre": "Fiction", "price": 20, "publishedYear": 2020, "author": "{{authorId2}}" }